{
  "_id": "tg-rich",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Abram was very rich in cattle, Gen. 13:2. lest thou shouldest say, I have made Abram rich, Gen. 14:23. rich shall not give more, Ex. 30:15. Lord maketh poor, and maketh rich, 1 Sam. 2:7. hand of the diligent maketh rich, Prov. 10:4. blessing of the Lord, it maketh rich, Prov. 10:22. maketh himself rich, yet hath nothing, Prov. 13:7. rich hath many friends, Prov. 14:20. rich man’s wealth is his strong city, Prov. 18:11. rich and poor meet together, Prov. 22:2. rich ruleth over the poor, Prov. 22:7. giveth to the rich, shall surely come to want, Prov. 22:16. Labour not to be rich, Prov. 23:4. rich man is wise in his own conceit, Prov. 28:11. he that maketh haste to be rich shall not be innocent, Prov. 28:20. his grave with the wicked, and with the rich in his death, Isa. 53:9 (Mosiah 14:9). let not the rich man glory in his riches, Jer. 9:23. rich men thereof are full of violence, Micah 6:12.",
