    {
      "text": "he that hath eternal life is rich, D&C 6:7 (11:7). the rich have I made, D&C 38:16. Wo unto you rich men, that will not give your substance, D&C 56:16. call upon the rich … to repent, D&C 58:47. the poor to administer to their wants by humbling the rich, D&C 84:112. poor shall be exalted, in that the rich are made low, D&C 104:16. they shall bring forth their rich treasures, D&C 133:30.",
      "references": [
        {
          "text": "D&C 6:7",
          "start": 35,
          "end": 42,
